OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fcloudy start to the evening but heavy
OL,7,Frain, with snow over high ground, soon
OL,8,Fspreading eastwards and continuing
OL,9,Fovernight. Strong winds and coastal
OL,10,Fgales possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fand hill snow in the morning,
OL,14,Fgradually clearing eastwards. Turning
OL,15,Fbrighter and drier in the west. Breezy
OL,16,Fat first, then winds become light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
