OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy,
OL,6,Fwith some light rain or drizzle
OL,7,Fpossible on Saturday. Breezy with
OL,8,Fbright spells and showers on Sunday.
OL,9,FMilder with rain and strong winds
OL,10,Farriving from the west on Monday.
